<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 7.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Jul 122.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 84.00/84.50</p>
<p>Avon range Jul 84.00</p>
<p>Cheshire first half Aug 88.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Tilbury harvest 78.00</p>
</text>
